<body class="bg-bg font-ui text-ink2 antialiased">

<!-- TOP BAR -->
<header class="sticky top-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line/80 bg-bg/90 px-6 py-3.5 backdrop-blur">
  <a href="/" class="font-data text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.1em] text-ink2">EARL</a>
  <nav class="flex items-center gap-3">
    <a href="/newsletter" class="rounded-sm border border-line px-3.5 py-1.5 font-data text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.08em] text-ink/80 transition hover:border-ink hover:text-ink2">Newsletter</a>
    <a href="/login" id="nav-auth-link" class="rounded-sm border border-line px-3.5 py-1.5 font-data text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.08em] text-ink/80 transition hover:border-ink hover:text-ink2">Sign In</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-line/80" id="hero">
  <canvas id="hero-canvas"></canvas>
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 px-6 py-20 md:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] md:py-28">
    <div>
      <div class="mb-5 font-data text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-golddark">For the small business owner</div>
      <h1 class="kinetic mb-6 text-fluid-3xl font-bold leading-[1.08] text-ink2">You started this to do more of what you love. Nobody mentioned the other eighteen jobs that came with it.</h1>
      <p class="mb-8 max-w-md text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Being great at your craft and knowing how to run a business turn out to be two completely different skills. You found that out somewhere between the excitement of starting and the reality of surviving. Earl is here for the owner who is still trying to find their way back to why they started.</p>
      <a href="/intake" class="inline-block self-start rounded-md bg-gold px-8 py-4 font-data text-xs tracking-[0.1em] text-dark shadow-lg shadow-gold/20 transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-golddark hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/30">Start the free interview</a>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink/40">One-time payment. Six months of full access. No recurring billing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal order-first md:order-none">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/40 shadow-2xl shadow-ink2/10">
        <img src="/assets/hero.jpg" alt="Small business owner overwhelmed by decisions, papers, and late nights." class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover object-[center_top] md:aspect-auto md:h-[440px]" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- THE PROBLEM -->
<section class="px-6 py-20" id="problem">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-reading">
    <div class="mb-6 font-data text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-golddark">The part nobody warns you about</div>
    <div class="reveal space-y-5 text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
      <p>Nobody warned you about this part. Not the work itself, which you were always good at, but the weight of everything that comes with owning the business that does the work.</p>
      <p>You did not sign up to be a manager, an accountant, a salesperson, and a strategist on top of the thing you actually came here to do. You signed up because you were good at something and believed that skill was enough to build a life around. The business was supposed to be the vehicle. Somewhere it became the destination.</p>
      <p>The advice that exists for people in your position was built for someone else. Courses want you to scale. Coaches want you to think like a CEO. Books assume you have a team executing while you strategize. None of that is what you are dealing with. What you are dealing with is this: the decisions that will shape the next three years get made in five minutes, alone, on a gut feeling, with no one to think them through with.</p>
      <p class="text-fluid-lg font-medium text-ink2">That is what wears people down. Not the work. The isolation of it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- A DIFFERENT KIND OF HELP -->
<section class="border-y border-line bg-white px-6 py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-4xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-[200px_1fr] sm:text-left">
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <img src="/assets/earl.png" alt="Earl" width="180" height="180" class="h-44 w-44 rounded-full border-2 border-gold object-cover object-[center_top] shadow-[0_5px_22px_rgba(10,10,15,0.15)]" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="mb-2 font-data text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-golddark">A different kind of help</div>
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-fluid-xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink2">Not just another AI and not a mentor you can only afford once.</h2>
      <p class="text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/80">A good mentor has lived it and asks the question you are avoiding. An AI holds every book ever written and never gets tired. Earl is what you get when the judgment of the first meets the memory of the second. He was built from the collected wisdom of every serious book ever written about surviving and running a small business. When he gives you an answer, it comes from somewhere real.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="px-6 py-20" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="mb-2 font-data text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-golddark">How it works</div>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-fluid-xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink2">Earl does not let you just start chatting.</h2>
    <p class="mb-10 max-w-2xl text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Most AI tools give you a blank box and wait for you to figure out what to ask. Earl starts differently, because the answers you get are only as useful as the context behind them.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-ink2/5">
        <div class="mb-2 font-data text-4xl text-line">01</div>
        <div class="mb-2 text-fluid-base font-semibold text-ink2">Answer the interview first</div>
        <div class="text-fluid-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Three stages, about twenty-five minutes in total, covering your business, your goals, your numbers, and what you are actually trying to build. Earl needs to know who you are before he can help you with anything.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-ink2/5">
        <div class="mb-2 font-data text-4xl text-line">02</div>
        <div class="mb-2 text-fluid-base font-semibold text-ink2">Review your Navigation Chart</div>
        <div class="text-fluid-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">When the interview is done, Earl produces a plain-language read of your specific situation: where the danger is, what to stop doing, where your leverage is, and what the next ninety days should focus on. Not theory. Your business.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-ink2/5">
        <div class="mb-2 font-data text-4xl text-line">03</div>
        <div class="mb-2 text-fluid-base font-semibold text-ink2">Talk with Earl who already knows you</div>
        <div class="text-fluid-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">From there, every conversation starts from what Earl learned about you. Bring any decision, any problem, any question you cannot shake. He asks before he answers and tracks every step you commit to between sessions.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <a href="/intake" class="inline-block rounded-sm bg-gold px-7 py-3.5 font-data text-xs tracking-[0.1em] text-dark transition hover:bg-golddark">Start the free interview</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- A LOOK INSIDE -->
<section class="border-t border-line bg-[#fffdf8] px-6 py-20" id="inside">
  <div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">
    <div class="mb-2 font-data text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-golddark">A look inside</div>
    <h2 class="mb-2 text-fluid-xl font-bold text-ink2">Here is the format, so you know what to expect.</h2>
    <p class="text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/70">You do not just start chatting with an AI. Earl learns who you are and where you are going first. That extra step is exactly what makes everything after it useful.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-4xl grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="reveal rounded-xl border border-line bg-bg p-4 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-lg">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-4">
        <div class="mb-3 flex gap-1.5">
          <div class="h-[7px] flex-1 rounded bg-gold"></div>
          <div class="h-[7px] flex-1 rounded" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c8a96e 55%,#e0d8c8 55%)"></div>
          <div class="h-[7px] flex-1 rounded bg-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm text-ink/80"><strong>Stage 2 of 3 · Your numbers</strong></div>
        <div class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink/50">Question 11 of 13</div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 font-data text-[0.68rem] text-ink/50">First, the interview. Earl learns who you are.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal rounded-xl border border-line bg-bg p-4 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-lg">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-4">
        <div class="mb-2 max-w-[88%] rounded-xl bg-earl px-3 py-2 text-[0.78rem] leading-snug text-ink">What specifically are you trying to fix this month?</div>
        <div class="mb-2 ml-auto max-w-[88%] rounded-xl bg-ink2 px-3 py-2 text-[0.78rem] leading-snug text-bg">Cash. We look profitable but we are always short.</div>
        <div class="max-w-[88%] rounded-xl bg-earl px-3 py-2 text-[0.78rem] leading-snug text-ink">Then we start with the gap between what you bill and what you bank.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 font-data text-[0.68rem] text-ink/50">Then you talk, and Earl already knows your business.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal rounded-xl border border-line bg-bg p-4 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-lg">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-4">
        <div class="font-data text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink/50">Kill Risk</div>
        <div class="text-[0.74rem] leading-snug text-ink/80">You are the only one who can sell right now, and you do not want to.</div>
        <div class="mt-2.5 font-data text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink/50">90-Day Focus</div>
        <div class="text-[0.74rem] leading-snug text-ink/80">Close one paying customer before the move. Everything else waits.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 font-data text-[0.68rem] text-ink/50">Your Navigation Chart, a real strategic picture of your business.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal rounded-xl border border-line bg-bg p-4 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-lg">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-ink2"></span>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="text-[0.82rem] font-bold leading-tight text-ink2">I have customers paying for the product</div>
            <span class="my-1.5 inline-block rounded-full bg-[#e8e8f6] px-2 py-0.5 font-data text-[0.55rem] tracking-[0.08em] text-[#5a5fb0]">IN PROGRESS</span>
            <div class="my-1.5 border-l-2 border-line pl-2 text-[0.74rem] leading-snug text-ink/80">Close the endocrinologist at our 4pm meeting tomorrow.</div>
            <div class="font-data text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.04em] text-golddark">+ ADD ACTION STEP</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 font-data text-[0.68rem] text-ink/50">Your goals and the steps underneath each of them, tracked between sessions.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT CHANGES -->
<section class="bg-dark px-6 py-20" id="what-changes">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <div class="mb-3 font-data text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">What this is actually about</div>
    <h2 class="mb-8 text-fluid-xl font-bold leading-tight text-bg">Six months from now, the gap between the business you have and the life you wanted when you started it either starts to close or it does not.</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-fluid-base font-bold text-bg">What changes when you have real direction</h3>
        <p class="mb-3 text-fluid-sm leading-relaxed text-[#a8a098]">You stop making the big calls alone. You have a clear picture of what matters and what is noise, a direction built around what you actually want, and someone who knows your whole situation every time a decision comes up. The action steps you commit to between conversations do not fall through the cracks. You start spending more of your time on the twenty percent of things that produce eighty percent of the results.</p>
        <p class="text-fluid-sm leading-relaxed text-[#a8a098]">The owners who get through this come out describing the same thing. They stopped feeling uncertain, drained, and trapped, and started feeling like they remembered why they did this in the first place.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-fluid-base font-bold text-[#c87a6a]">What happens if nothing changes</h3>
        <p class="mb-3 text-fluid-sm leading-relaxed text-[#a8a098]">You keep grinding. You keep making the same kinds of decisions with the same amount of uncertainty. The business does not fail dramatically. It fades, slowly and quietly, until one day the math stops working and the option that is left is the one you left to avoid: a normal job, a paycheck, no ownership of your own time, no retirement on your own terms.</p>
        <p class="text-fluid-sm leading-relaxed text-[#a8a098]">That is the version most small business owners are living. Not because they are not good at what they do, but because they never had anyone in their corner who actually understood their situation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ACCESS -->
<section class="px-6 py-20" id="pricing">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
    <div class="mb-2 font-data text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-golddark">Get access</div>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-fluid-xl font-bold text-ink2">One price. Six months. Full access.</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-fluid-base leading-relaxed text-ink/70">A single session with a business consultant typically runs anywhere from $150 to $400. They take notes. They forget half of what you told them by next time. Earl remembers everything from every conversation for six months and is there whenever a decision needs to be made.</p>

    <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-md rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-8 text-left shadow-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold/50 hover:shadow-xl">
      <div class="font-data text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-ink2">Earl Membership</div>
      <div class="mb-5 text-fluid-sm text-ink/60">Six months of full access, one-time payment</div>
      <ul class="mb-7 space-y-3">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="#c8a96e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mt-1 flex-none"><polyline points="2 7 6 11 12 3"/></svg>
          <span class="text-fluid-sm leading-snug text-ink/80">Unlimited conversations with Earl who knows your business</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="#c8a96e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mt-1 flex-none"><polyline points="2 7 6 11 12 3"/></svg>
          <span class="text-fluid-sm leading-snug text-ink/80">Navigation Chart built from your specific interview answers</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="#c8a96e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mt-1 flex-none"><polyline points="2 7 6 11 12 3"/></svg>
          <span class="text-fluid-sm leading-snug text-ink/80">Your goals and action steps tracked between every conversation</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="#c8a96e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mt-1 flex-none"><polyline points="2 7 6 11 12 3"/></svg>
